<InfoPage title="Website terms" description="Terms for using the public wrenlore.com website and the distinction between site content and WrenLore software licensing." updated="21 November 2026">
  <h2>Public information</h2>
  <p>wrenlore.com describes the WrenLore open-source project and links to its source, releases and deployment documentation. The site is provided for general information. Features can change between releases, and operators should verify requirements against the exact source revision they plan to deploy.</p>

  <h2>Software licence</h2>
