  <h2>No warranty or hosted service</h2>
  <p>The public project and website are provided without warranty, to the extent stated by their respective licences. The website does not create a support contract, service-level agreement or hosted WrenLore account.</p>

  <h2>Third-party names</h2>
  <p>Confluence, Notion, Docmost and other product names belong to their respective owners. Comparison pages identify interoperability and evaluation context. WrenLore is not presented as an official distribution or endorsed product of those companies.</p>

  <h2>Responsible use</h2>
  <p>Operators are responsible for securing their deployment, configuring identity and model providers, maintaining backups, applying updates and meeting obligations that apply to their organisation and data.</p>
</InfoPage>
